#% title
# region_intersection

#% text
# `region_intersection(r1, r2, ...)` is the intersection of plane polygons as a polygon (`empty_region(2)` when they do not meet).

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
region_intersection(rectangle([0, 0], [2, 2]), triangle([[1, 1], [3, 1], [1, 3]]))
#% output
#= polygon([[1, 1], [2, 1], [2, 2], [1, 2]])

